Usage: silt run [--watch] [--disassemble] <file.silt> [-- <args>...]

Options:
  --watch, -w         Re-run on file changes
  --disassemble       Show bytecode disassembly instead of running
  -- <args>...        Pass the arguments after it to the program (io.args())

Examples:
  silt run                      (inside a package, runs src/main.silt)
  silt run main.silt
  silt run main.silt -- input.txt
  silt run --watch main.silt
  silt run --disassemble main.silt
